{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1017030-ananasi-feeding-and-reproduction","id":1017030,"title":"Ananasi Feeding and Reproduction","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-14T06:33:11-08:00","id":1017030,"title":"Ananasi Feeding and Reproduction","content":"The majority of Ananasi are rather cold and manipulative people who are more ruthless than any other form of sane Fera, so I think it would be normal for them to combine feeding with sex (they get a light meal and sexual pleasure in one package). In the case of heterosexual male Ananasi, they also have the opportunity to produce more Kinfolk or potential Ananasi, as long as they do not take more than two blood points from their sexual partner (more than that increases the chances of complications that may kill their sexual partner). <br /> <br /> If they find a new sexual partner every night, they will get an average of nine of them pregnant every year (assuming they seduce women who do not use contraception and who are unwilling to have an abortion). 10% of their children will be Ananasi and, with an average of thirty years of fertility, each male Ananasi could sire 270 human Kinfolk children, 27 of whom are homid Ananasi. If male Ananasi are so ruthless though, why are there not a lot more Ananasi in existence?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T11:28:36-08:00","id":1017174,"title":"","content":"Now consider that spiders can give birth to 1000+ eggs, most of which can hatch, and you could easily pump those numbers up by several magnitudes.<br /> <br /> I think at the end of the day, shapeshifting is as much spiritual as generic, so just pumping out lots of babies doesn't necessarily mean that you'll have lots of actual Ananasi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T12:16:05-08:00","id":1017201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1017030-ananasi-feeding-and-reproduction#post1017030\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The majority of Ananasi are rather cold and manipulative people who are more ruthless than any other form of sane Fera, so I think it would be normal for them to combine feeding with sex (they get a light meal and sexual pleasure in one package). In the case of heterosexual male Ananasi, they also have the opportunity to produce more Kinfolk or potential Ananasi, as long as they do not take more than two blood points from their sexual partner (more than that increases the chances of complications that may kill their sexual partner).<br /> <br /> If they find a new sexual partner every night, they will get an average of nine of them pregnant every year (assuming they seduce women who do not use contraception and who are unwilling to have an abortion). 10% of their children will be Ananasi and, with an average of thirty years of fertility, each male Ananasi could sire 270 human Kinfolk children, 27 of whom are homid Ananasi. If male Ananasi are so ruthless though, why are there not a lot more Ananasi in existence?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1017030-ananasi-feeding-and-reproduction?p=1017174#post1017174\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I think at the end of the day, shapeshifting is as much spiritual as generic, so just pumping out lots of babies doesn't necessarily mean that you'll have lots of actual Ananasi.</div> </div> </div> </div>This.<br /> <br /> Combined with the fact that I disagree with most of the premises in the OP. Ananasi don't have a pleasurable bite like Vampires, so feeding and sex don't naturally go together. And getting sexual pleasure is kind of an odd motivation for a creature with such an alien mindset imo. Having a different partner (with your specific criteria) every night for a year just isn't really a thing. And pursuing that would certainly take away from said Ananasi actually doing their job for the Queen. Also, their Queen could possibly just first Change more Ananasi if she needed them. She obviously doesn't seem to think she does. And even saying she couldn't do that directly, as <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar741_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"741\" data-vbnamecard=\"741\">AnubisXy</a> points out, spider born would be much much better for increasing Ananasi population.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T18:43:01-08:00","id":1017430,"title":"","content":"Add that the numbers for Garou don't have to be true for other changers, much less for Ananasi.<br /> <br /> The necessity of having a good child, with health and context to grow properly, can also mean a far more cautious take on reproduction. By the way, a number of Ananasi actually marry.<br /> <br /> Oh, and Ananasi have less emotion, but emotional responses are still present. So they <u>can</u> make decisions out of emotion or impulse, even if in kind of an alien way.<br /> <br /> Not to say that Ananasi also die a lot. They are self-predators, cannibals, all of them. It isn't a corrupt thing for them, just a natural behavior.<br /> <br /> Finally, well... there <u>is</u> a great number of them. They are very secretive, but also maybe the most numerous of all changers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T02:46:53-08:00","id":1017556,"title":"","content":"Yes, exactly, there are hints in various places that they outnumber the Ratkin through their spider kin and just keep their numbers secret. As for sexual emotion (and this is from my play experience), they still have them but they are somewhat alien in the way they regard them. To an Ananasi, everything, including what they and others feel, are parts of the Great Web that they must master by learning to navigate the strands and spin them into forms that please their Queen. There is an ulterior motive. But to say they are cold is only measuring things from a human perspective. They are just as vulnerable to feelings, in the end, as the ultimate fate of many Hatar shows. Probably one reason why they do not fuck around and break human hearts everywhere is the fact that while immune to mundane diseases they can still pass them on. They would calculate that diseased kin are unworthy of their Queen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2157-deejay","name":"deejay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}